{"3956860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Battlethorne: Reckoning", "steam_appid": 3956860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A third-person action-strategy RPG where you lead armies, build bases, and fight in massive large-scale battles.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge into combat as one of seven unique classes—or take command like a strategist, building defenses, summoning units, and shaping the flow of war in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956860/extras/5601b9a57a167aacd1af3a7f21d35103.poster.avif?t=1771311095\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956860/extras/5601b9a57a167aacd1af3a7f21d35103.webm?t=1771311095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seven Hero Classes</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your champion and master unique powers that can change the tide of war:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warrior (Two-Handed Axe): Leap across the battlefield, crush enemies, and ignite foes in flame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paladin (Sword &amp; Shield): Shield allies with barriers, pull enemies in, and charge through enemy lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assassin (Daggers): Strike from the shadows with invisibility, traps, and deadly finishers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Archer (Bow): Pin down enemies, unleash multishot volleys, and dominate at long range.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mage (Staff): Heal allies, call down icy meteors, and freeze squads in place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summoner (Wands): Command wolves and spiders, dodge with spirit clones, and swarm the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warden (Hammer): Close the gap with a leaping strike, unleash shockwaves that knock enemies down, and slam the ground to slow foes around him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build &amp; Command Like a Strategist</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956860/extras/e0bfdca96abfe7600a54ff1397e8871f.poster.avif?t=1771311095\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956860/extras/e0bfdca96abfe7600a54ff1397e8871f.webm?t=1771311095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your hero isn’t just a fighter—they’re a commander. Construct buildings to control the battlefield:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defenses: Turrets, artillery, and energy shields.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support: Healing shrines, snare shrines, and supply posts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Economy &amp; Production: Houses that spawn workers, miners that gather minerals, smiths that repair buildings, and guards that defend your outposts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every building you place changes the flow of war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Massive Battles</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956860/extras/8f6c58430685070ebf210bf69525ee7e.poster.avif?t=1771311095\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956860/extras/8f6c58430685070ebf210bf69525ee7e.webm?t=1771311095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wage war across vast open maps with dozens of capture points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight alongside hundreds of allies against enemy factions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride your steed to strike where you’re needed most.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware the wild beast factions, who attack everyone and can flip the balance of power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression &amp; Loot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect weapons, armor, and treasures from enemies and hidden chests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple armor sets, each with unique bonuses—boost damage, health, or ability cooldowns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your build mid-battle to dominate the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battlethorne Reckoning is the ultimate blend of action RPG combat and real-time strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight, build, and command your way to victory in a living battlefield where every choice matters.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A third-person action-strategy RPG where you lead armies, build bases, and fight in massive large-scale battles.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge into combat as one of seven unique classes—or take command like a strategist, building defenses, summoning units, and shaping the flow of war in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956860/extras/5601b9a57a167aacd1af3a7f21d35103.poster.avif?t=1771311095\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956860/extras/5601b9a57a167aacd1af3a7f21d35103.webm?t=1771311095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seven Hero Classes</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your champion and master unique powers that can change the tide of war:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warrior (Two-Handed Axe): Leap across the battlefield, crush enemies, and ignite foes in flame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paladin (Sword &amp; Shield): Shield allies with barriers, pull enemies in, and charge through enemy lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assassin (Daggers): Strike from the shadows with invisibility, traps, and deadly finishers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Archer (Bow): Pin down enemies, unleash multishot volleys, and dominate at long range.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mage (Staff): Heal allies, call down icy meteors, and freeze squads in place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summoner (Wands): Command wolves and spiders, dodge with spirit clones, and swarm the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warden (Hammer): Close the gap with a leaping strike, unleash shockwaves that knock enemies down, and slam the ground to slow foes around him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build &amp; Command Like a Strategist</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956860/extras/e0bfdca96abfe7600a54ff1397e8871f.poster.avif?t=1771311095\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956860/extras/e0bfdca96abfe7600a54ff1397e8871f.webm?t=1771311095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your hero isn’t just a fighter—they’re a commander. Construct buildings to control the battlefield:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defenses: Turrets, artillery, and energy shields.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support: Healing shrines, snare shrines, and supply posts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Economy &amp; Production: Houses that spawn workers, miners that gather minerals, smiths that repair buildings, and guards that defend your outposts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every building you place changes the flow of war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Massive Battles</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956860/extras/8f6c58430685070ebf210bf69525ee7e.poster.avif?t=1771311095\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956860/extras/8f6c58430685070ebf210bf69525ee7e.webm?t=1771311095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wage war across vast open maps with dozens of capture points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight alongside hundreds of allies against enemy factions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride your steed to strike where you’re needed most.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware the wild beast factions, who attack everyone and can flip the balance of power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression &amp; Loot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect weapons, armor, and treasures from enemies and hidden chests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple armor sets, each with unique bonuses—boost damage, health, or ability cooldowns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your build mid-battle to dominate the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battlethorne Reckoning is the ultimate blend of action RPG combat and real-time strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight, build, and command your way to victory in a living battlefield where every choice matters.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Fight, build, and strategize in a massive third-person action-strategy RPG with hundreds of units and large-scale tactical battles across vast battlefields.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956860/9d2e168ead1ce372ad94b462ea4fc4866a84cdc1/header.jpg?t=1771311095", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956860/536d3f09e675196c19ddcd73b414c2ef7775e6d0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771311095", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956860/536d3f09e675196c19ddcd73b414c2ef7775e6d0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771311095", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> INTEL CORE I5-8400 or AMD RYZEN 3 3300X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GEFORCE GTX 1060 3 GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Windo